The line items applies to the stucco repairs per McDermott Construction
Scope of work:
- Includes removal of all ivy on entire house
- Includes removal and mapping of gutters prior to stucco work
- Includes pressure washing of all walls to remove soot and fire damage and ivy removal debris
- Includes covering all doors and windows with 2 mil plastic and duct tape
- Includes covering all floors with 4 mil plastic, jumbo tex, and duct tape
- Includes sandblasting of existing stucco surfaces as needed
- Includes new lath around all new doors and windows
- Includes application of scratch coat around all new doors and windows
- Includes application of brown coat around all new doors and windows
- Includes new fiberglass netting installed to entire building
- Includes stucco entire building to a smooth “cat face” finish with new color coat and embedded color (painting not required)
- Includes final site protection and cleanup
